{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "fe0ee9fc-be33-8756-b3a1-b9e19841addb",
  "created_at": "2026-01-28T11:07:53-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Finance",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Min-jun Mensah",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Luis Barros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T11:05:00-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Finance Department, this is Luis. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T11:05:04-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello, good morning. I have a parking ticket, and I want to ask about it. I think it is not correct ticket."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T11:05:13-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, let's have a look. What's the problem with it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T11:05:17-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The meter was broken. I put coins in, quarters, maybe four, but the screen did not show any time. Nothing register. Then I go to my appointment, and when I come back, the ticket is on my car."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T11:05:31-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ah, the classic. Coins go in, nothing comes out. Did you happen to take a picture of the meter?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T11:05:38-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, I take one photo, the screen is blank. And also the meter number, I write it down."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T11:05:45-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good, that helps. You'd want to file an appeal and include the photo and the meter number with the ticket number. Do you have the ticket in front of you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T11:05:56-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, I have it. Sorry, one moment. [pause] I am eating lunch, a granola bar, so I am sorry if I am chewing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T11:06:05-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem, I've heard worse lunches. Take your time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T11:06:09-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, thank you. The ticket number begin with two letters, then six number. Do you need it now?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T11:06:16-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not for what you're asking. For the appeal itself you'll put it on the form. Is there something else on it you wanted to know?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T11:06:26-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. How long the appeal take? Like, one week, one month?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T11:06:31-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Usually a few weeks, give or take. You'll get a letter in the mail with the decision. Keep your photo and a copy of everything."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T11:06:41-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A few weeks. Okay. And during this time, the ticket, it is still there? I need to pay first?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T11:06:48-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Check the due date on the ticket. If you're worried about it, you can ask us to note the appeal on the account when you file. Bring it in or send it, either way."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T11:07:01-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Also, I work during the day, so I cannot come when the office is open. If I want to pay, is there a way after the office is closed? I heard maybe a drop box."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T11:07:14-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, there's a payment drop box at City Hall. Check or money order, with the ticket number written on it. No cash, please. Don't put cash in the box."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T11:07:25-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No cash. Check or money order, ticket number on it. Okay, I understand."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T11:07:30-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You've got it. Want me to take a number in case we need to reach you about the appeal?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T11:07:37-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, please. It is 401-555-0196."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T11:07:40-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 401-555-0196. Anything else for me today?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T11:07:44-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that is all. Thank you very much for your help."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T11:07:49-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Enjoy the rest of the granola bar."
    }
  ],
